{
  "_purpose": "Manual sector/industry map for pre-listing IPOs. NSE equity industryInfo (macro/sector/industry/basicIndustry) only resolves AFTER an IPO lists. For pre-listing IPOs in our dashboard, populate one entry per IPO at seed time.",
